{"t":"Fire Wall","s":"fire-wall-abe5a","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Fire_Wall_83ea71.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Fire Wall</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Fire Wall\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Wall_83ea71.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">adevo mas grav flam</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damagetype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Magic Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">780</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Support Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Support_Cooldown_5c2691.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Support (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"soul\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Soul Points</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">33</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"runegroup\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rune Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Attack Runes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p>Makes 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Wall%20Rune\">Fire Wall Runes</a> (requiring 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Rune\">Blank Rune</a>). <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Burned Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burned_Icon_c21ba6.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span> Creates a 1×5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field\">Fire Fields</a> area if shot straight from the body. If shot on an angle, a total of 9 fire field squares will be made spanning 5 fields vertical and 5 fields horizontal.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>The Fire Wall spell is one of the oldest known enchantments, and it has proved its worth on countless occasions. It offers reliable protection against all creatures that are afraid of fire, and many an adventurer who travels through the wilderness uses these runes to make sure he gets some undisturbed rest. The exceptionally long duration of the spell as well as the possibility to form massive barriers or even protective circles out of fire walls make this a versatile, practical spell that should not miss in any druid's or sorcerer's spellbook.\nPlease note that on optional PvP game worlds this spell has no damaging effect on other characters, unless characters are war opponents.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Support_Spells\">Support Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Animate Dead</li><li>Arrow Call</li><li>Aura of Exposed Weakness</li><li>Aura of Sapped Strength</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Avalanche\">Avalanche</a></li><li>Avatar of Balance</li><li>Avatar of Light</li><li>Avatar of Nature</li><li>Avatar of Steel</li><li>Avatar of Storm</li><li>Balanced Brawl</li><li>Blood Rage</li><li>Cancel Invisibility</li><li>Cancel Magic Shield</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Challenge\">Challenge</a></li><li>Chameleon</li><li>Charge</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chivalrous%20Challenge\">Chivalrous Challenge</a></li><li>Conjure Arrow</li><li>Conjure Explosive Arrow</li><li>Conjure Wand of Darkness</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Convince%20Creature\">Convince Creature</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Illusion\">Creature Illusion</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison%20Rune\">Cure Poison Rune</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a></li><li>Disintegrate</li><li>Divine Dazzle</li><li>Divine Defiance</li><li>Divine Empowerment</li><li>Elemental Synthesis</li><li>Enchant Party</li><li>Enchant Spear</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bomb\">Energy Bomb</a></li><li><a href=